{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美元匯價錄得超過一個月以來，首個星期下跌。</p><p></p><p>反映美元兌六隻主要貨幣的美匯指數收市報101.779，跌幅近百分之0.3。全個星期計，跌幅百分之0.4。</p><p></p><p>美國偏強的通脹數據令美元匯價本周初走高，但美國聯儲局官員表示不急於進一步收緊貨幣政策，有助穩定美國債息，並削弱美元匯價。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T22:59:26.163131+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:39.268640+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T22:57:40.573406+00:00","content_hash":"ac1e617f47a3842c68ca8b029fba235f14d81a314322b8c0179dde6661448b91","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}